{"id":"2d84a32e163edd84","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge.md","title":"df arithmetic sequent bridge","display":"df arithmetic sequent bridge","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge","aliases":["72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge"],"display":"df arithmetic sequent bridge","depends_on":["[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","[[72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge]]","[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","[[72-df-omega-rule]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II arithmetic sequent calculus; explicit local translation connecting independently encoded arithmetic and core calculi","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df arithmetic sequent bridge"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"494fa4cd0ce92258\" href=\"?note=494fa4cd0ce92258\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge\">72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"42b817f141b6851c\" href=\"?note=42b817f141b6851c\" title=\"72-df-omega-rule\">72-df-omega-rule</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II arithmetic sequent calculus; explicit local translation connecting independently encoded arithmetic and core calculi"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PA}\">\\(\\mathsf{PA}\\)</span>、数语法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_A\">\\(\\Sigma_A\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"494fa4cd0ce92258\" href=\"?note=494fa4cd0ce92258\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge\">72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge</a> 的五元数签名；目标使用core的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma_A)\\)</span> 与LK序列相继式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_t,J_f\">\\(J_t,J_f\\)</span> 是以下从x_i到v_i的数语法翻译；原始构造为0,S,+,·、数等号、小于、¬、→、∀。基本语法中的∃/∧/∨先按已定义经典宏展开。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eq}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{Eq}_2\\)</span> 是显示的数相等逻辑公理句集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 遍历数项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_N\">\\(x\\in V_N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}\">\\(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}\\)</span> 是加入公理初始式的演算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega}\">\\(\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega}\\)</span> 再加入 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"42b817f141b6851c\" href=\"?note=42b817f141b6851c\" title=\"72-df-omega-rule\">72-df-omega-rule</a> 的完整带标签规则集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma_A),\\mathrm{LK}_{\\Sigma_A},\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_{\\Sigma_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma_A),\\mathrm{LK}_{\\Sigma_A},\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_{\\Sigma_A}\\)</span> 分别取所引核心节点的相继式集、LK演算和ω规则集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>特化 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"42b817f141b6851c\" href=\"?note=42b817f141b6851c\" title=\"72-df-omega-rule\">72-df-omega-rule</a> 时，其指定零常量取本签名的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，指定一元后继符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>；因而该规则的数码递归为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline0=0\">\\(\\overline0=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{n+1}=S\\overline n\">\\(\\overline{n+1}=S\\overline n\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nJ_t(x_i)&amp;:=v_i,\\quad J_t(0):=0,\\quad J_t(St):=S(J_t(t)),\\quad J_t(t+u):=J_t(t)+J_t(u),\\quad J_t(t\\cdot u):=J_t(t)\\cdot J_t(u),\\\\\nJ_f(t=u)&amp;:=(J_t(t)\\doteq J_t(u)),\\quad J_f(t&lt;u):=(J_t(t)&lt;J_t(u)),\\\\\nJ_f(\\neg A)&amp;:=\\neg J_f(A),\\quad J_f(A\\to B):=J_f(A)\\to J_f(B),\\quad J_f(\\forall x_iA):=\\forall v_iJ_f(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Eq}_2&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(t=t):t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(s=t\\to(A[s/x]\\to A[t/x])):s,t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\\land x\\in V_N\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}&amp;:=\\langle\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma_A),\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathrm{LK}_{\\Sigma_A})\\cup\\{\\langle(),\\langle J_f(A)\\rangle\\rangle:A\\in\\mathsf{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{Eq}_2\\},\\operatorname{Rules}(\\mathrm{LK}_{\\Sigma_A})\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega}&amp;:=\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}+\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_{\\Sigma_A}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nJ_t(x_i)&amp;:=v_i,\\quad J_t(0):=0,\\quad J_t(St):=S(J_t(t)),\\quad J_t(t+u):=J_t(t)+J_t(u),\\quad J_t(t\\cdot u):=J_t(t)\\cdot J_t(u),\\\\\nJ_f(t=u)&amp;:=(J_t(t)\\doteq J_t(u)),\\quad J_f(t&lt;u):=(J_t(t)&lt;J_t(u)),\\\\\nJ_f(\\neg A)&amp;:=\\neg J_f(A),\\quad J_f(A\\to B):=J_f(A)\\to J_f(B),\\quad J_f(\\forall x_iA):=\\forall v_iJ_f(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Eq}_2&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(t=t):t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(s=t\\to(A[s/x]\\to A[t/x])):s,t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\\land x\\in V_N\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}&amp;:=\\langle\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma_A),\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathrm{LK}_{\\Sigma_A})\\cup\\{\\langle(),\\langle J_f(A)\\rangle\\rangle:A\\in\\mathsf{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{Eq}_2\\},\\operatorname{Rules}(\\mathrm{LK}_{\\Sigma_A})\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega}&amp;:=\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}+\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_{\\Sigma_A}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>J是实际数语法编码转换，不把L2与72内部core语法默认为字面相同。PA初始式和相等公理在标准N均真；LK本身没有隐含数相等逻辑规则，故这些公理必须明确加入。此节点只定义算术无穷相继式演算，不把PA归纳当作纯逻辑LK消割的可保留公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge","status":"resolved","id":"494fa4cd0ce92258","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-omega-rule","status":"resolved","id":"42b817f141b6851c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-omega-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PA}$、数语法 $\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)$ 与 $\\operatorname{ucl}$ 如 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]、[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]。$\\Sigma_A$ 是 [[72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge]] 的五元数签名；目标使用core的 $\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma_A)$ 与LK序列相继式。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolv