cal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma_A),\\mathrm{LK}_{\\Sigma_A},\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_{\\Sigma_A}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline0=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{n+1}=S\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nJ_t(x_i)&:=v_i,\\quad J_t(0):=0,\\quad J_t(St):=S(J_t(t)),\\quad J_t(t+u):=J_t(t)+J_t(u),\\quad J_t(t\\cdot u):=J_t(t)\\cdot J_t(u),\\\\\nJ_f(t=u)&:=(J_t(t)\\doteq J_t(u)),\\quad J_f(t<u):=(J_t(t)<J_t(u)),\\\\\nJ_f(\\neg A)&:=\\neg J_f(A),\\quad J_f(A\\to B):=J_f(A)\\to J_f(B),\\quad J_f(\\forall x_iA):=\\forall v_iJ_f(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Eq}_2&:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(t=t):t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(s=t\\to(A[s/x]\\to A[t/x])):s,t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\\land x\\in V_N\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}&:=\\langle\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma_A),\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathrm{LK}_{\\Sigma_A})\\cup\\{\\langle(),\\langle J_f(A)\\rangle\\rangle:A\\in\\mathsf{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{Eq}_2\\},\\operatorname{Rules}(\\mathrm{LK}_{\\Sigma_A})\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega}&:=\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}+\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_{\\Sigma_A}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3187,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge|df arithmetic sequent bridge]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge|df arithmetic sequent bridge]]"},{"id":"f63c4c620ad75ba4","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_A$、$J_f$、$\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}$、$\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega}$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge]]；core公式集为 $X_{\\Sigma_A}$，变量集为 $V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}$。目标相继式中的等式使用core构造子 $\\doteq$，不是两类算术语法中的 $=$。"}],"outgoing":["5e5fb64772853785","5ae195683ce3beb4","494fa4cd0ce92258","c60a11e47ac58326","42b817f141b6851c"]}